<https://birdlife.se/tk/stc/>
    dcterms:title "Förteckning över Sveriges fågeltaxa, version 2025: fynd t.o.m. 2023, and Officiella svenska namn på alla världens fågelarter, version 2025 (NL2025b.xlsx)" ;
    dcterms:creator "BirdLife Sverige: Taxonomikommittén and Raritetskommittén" ;
    rdfs:comment "https://birdlife.se/tk/stc/ — neither the page nor the downloadable lists state a licence (checked 2026-10-04), so they are treated as all rights reserved and used for verification only. The page says the lists follow AviList: \"Together with the board of BirdLife Sweden, we have decided though to fully adopt and endorse the unified global avian taxonomy of AviList (version 1, June 2025) from its release.\" and \"The taxonomy follows AviList v2025\"; NL2025b.xlsx is titled 'Officiella svenska namn på alla världens fågelarter, version 2025' (sheet 'NL v2025 (AviList v2025)')."@en .

